{"server":"cn","storyId":"act34side_level_act34side_08_beg","groupId":"act34side","stageId":"act34side_08","title":"“何谓存续？”","storyCode":"BP-8","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act34side/level_act34side_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"6bef786fb684b9f12b64c16a09b5070e0a0ecec869764ceccef31cff293f5223","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g4_aegirstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还好，差点被那家伙追上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卡、卡西娅，我一直在找你，你怎么消失了这么久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......卢契拉？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这孩子，傻站在这里干嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城市单元骨架需要检修，这也是战斗的一部分。信标塔的方向......城市里究竟发生了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣侵入了弥利亚留姆，那座塔已经变成了巢穴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里交给我吧，你赶紧去避险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太危险了......我留下来，我和你一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用，呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡西娅，你受伤了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你赶过来的时候，被那些海嗣——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，这种擦伤不可能是海嗣造成的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人攻击了你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你把安全阀拉出来做什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸，别往前推，这样会切断底层的自检系统，这里的城市单元骨架会停止运作的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，你当然比我清楚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡西娅，这才是你的目的吗？你是，你是深海教会的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你才在海巡队调查图利娅的时候，故意引导她们去怀疑她？难道说，她的失踪，就是你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在我脖子上放了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"长须栉齿草，一个负责培育行道珊瑚的朋友的作品。别乱动，如果被它的触须扎破皮肤，会很痛苦地死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，孩子，咳......离开这里。等你走得足够远，它会自动脱落。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想走的，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实在我们成为同僚之前，我就在发展规划所偶然看过你的评估资料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你之所以在意那个数据员，是因为自己始终没有忘记弥利亚留姆的那次撤离，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼看着远处的火山能源站的光亮一点点熄灭，周围只剩下无尽的黑暗，黑暗中只剩下海流的轰鸣和窸窣的异响......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那才是海洋原本的模样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那一刻，你是整个弥利亚留姆离海洋最近的人，你站在穹顶的夹层，周围一个人都没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"发展规划所评估你的心理压力过大，才同意你从穹顶系统转来地面。至于“恐高”，只是个无伤大雅的玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕连你自己都没有意识到，自己的内心深处藏着怎样的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩余的海嗣很快就会发现这条路还能通过，你不会想再次面对它们的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快走吧，还来得及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡西娅握住了安全阀，继续向前推着，她没有再看旁边这个总是爱开玩笑的后辈。\n安全阀突然停住，发出刺耳的锐响，卡西娅没能再推动一丝一毫——\n一双纤细的手抵住了另一端。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卢契拉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，要是在平时，我一定会很生气地反驳你，或者把这株什么草塞进我的墨水瓶里，跟你说这种恶作剧的水平太低。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，好亮啊......信标塔沉下去的方向，还有我们头顶的穹顶，整块大陆架上的海嗣都在朝弥利亚留姆涌过来，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些色彩诡异的光亮背后是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡西娅，你说的没错，海嗣在侵蚀我们的生活，我已经真真切切经历过一次了，我没法忘记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很羡慕图利娅，我们经历了类似的事情，可是从始至终，她都能守着自己珍视的东西，她很厉害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我却从穹顶逃到了地面，刚刚你来之前，我也真的想过从这里逃开......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我应该去哪里呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡西娅，我不能让你破坏城市单元骨架，我不能让海嗣涌进弥利亚留姆的其他城市单元，哪怕这株草真的能要了我的命！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为，因为我的身后已经没有路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1387_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这孩子，力气还真大......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"劳伦缇娜小姐的父母让我知道，穹顶可以很漂亮，可这块透明的结构，实际上是阿戈尔城市的眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实，我最近一直在问我自己......我们身处在一场战争里，眼睛就应该负责注视危险，不是吗？"},{"type":"narration","text":"她逼迫自己往前看，那些诡异的色彩倒映在她的瞳孔里，耳边传来呼啸的潮声和大海子嗣的呢喃。\n年轻的阿戈尔人紧紧抵住安全阀，她没有松手，她不敢松手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一只有力的手按住了她的肩膀，自己已经僵硬的肌肉几乎是被强迫着一点点放松，她这才回过神来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放松，放松，卢契拉小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡西娅她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暂时的麻痹。我失手射偏，只造成了擦伤，才导致毒素生效延迟了这么久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，让你的安全受到了威胁。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"执政官克莱门莎广播，弥利亚留姆全城听令！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"信标塔所在城市单元完成切割后，城市剩余部分向陆地方向迁移，撤出海嗣包围圈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"迁移过程中重启城市单元骨架联动装置，进行结构性重组，力场全开，阻挡涌向陆地的海嗣潮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"第八、第十军团以及海巡队，所有还能行驶的舰船轮流出港，为城市护航！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卢契拉小姐，我想，关于卡西娅的事件报告，或许由你来完成比较合适。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您直接去港口枢纽吧，执政官发布的战斗任务更紧急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡西娅已经被制服，我会先带她去看医师，然后......她应该受到惩罚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，我在想，如果城市要进行结构性重组的话，穹顶系统需要作为力场发生的原点，正面对抗海嗣潮，那边的人手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许我该提交一份回调岗位的紧急申请。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卢契拉小姐，你很勇敢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来您听到了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。在那之前，你或许也应该看一下医师，长须栉齿草确实有很强的神经毒性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢契拉","speakerId":"avg_4079_haini_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g9_shipport"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战列舰驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冲撞装甲、舰炮挂载、监测单元、伪装涂层、推进系统......全系统检测完毕，随时可以出发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战列舰驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们将以最快速度到达指定海域，阻挡来自北侧的海嗣潮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"港口枢纽管理员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"武器系统的所有权限已经开通，不必有所保留。别让它们靠近弥利亚留姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战列舰驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会尽全力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"港口枢纽管理员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们只是第一批。接下来，所有还能运作的舰船都会投入战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"港口枢纽管理员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们将轮流出航，为重组中的弥利亚留姆护航，并作为“高墙”的延伸，阻挡涌向陆地的海嗣群。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"港口枢纽管理员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以记住，收到换防指令，必须马上返航补给。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战列舰驾驶员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"港口枢纽管理员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......发现海嗣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"港口枢纽管理员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"残留在城市内的海嗣侵入了港口枢纽，不能让它们靠近舰艇库！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（痛苦地扭曲身体）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"看起来，这些家伙不仅在巢穴里埋伏了我们，还偷袭了我们的城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是糟心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1389_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（急促地扇动翼膜）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"裹在雕塑上？怎么，进入城市后，海嗣也开始有审美意识了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过，这尊《饮痛之人》也谈不上什么杰作，切坏了也没什么可惜的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"其实，断掉一只手臂，看起来反而更有魅力了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢夸奖，斯卡蒂。你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"离开巢穴后，已经缓过劲来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"港口枢纽管理员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是猎人们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"港口枢纽管理员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深海猎人平安返回了城市！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剑鱼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"二队长，你见到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我见过他了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们回来得刚好，你们应该已经听到了西昆妲在加急频道里的通报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"秘密潜入弥利亚留姆，入侵信标塔中控室，处死航道计划的武器技术顾问，最后选择与海嗣共同回归大洋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌尔比安身上的嫌疑恐怕很难再洗清了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓捕，甚至处决他，将是深海猎人今后不可推卸的任务之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"二队长......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽灵鲨","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂娅","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但此时此刻，我们的任务是搜索散落在各个城市单元的海嗣，将那些渣滓赶尽杀绝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g6_aegirarena"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......该说的，我已说完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛利图斯，你始终在回避最核心的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最核心的......问题......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你的描述中，遗迹之下的一切变故，你犯下的罪行与招致的恶果，仿佛都只出自某种笼罩着神秘色彩的“必然性”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我所知的玛利图斯，他是一个怪脾气的善思者，他习惯性地怀疑，从不武断地做任何决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他不会轻易地抛却理智，陷入神秘主义的陷阱；更不会否定自己的存在，漠视他人的价值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我做出选择，我造就结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾经的玛利图斯，在做出那个决定前的所思所想，为何值得你如此在意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛利图斯曾经的选择铸就了如今的你。不理解玛利图斯为何做出那个决定，就无法理解你是怎样的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......凯尔希，连你也关注这些细枝末节？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（颅腔内的核转动）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们当然在意，你们怎可能不在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曾经的那个人类，在吃下异种的血肉前，也经历过漫长的挣扎......一天，还是几个日夜？在遗迹的深处，时间无法度量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他恐惧，他怀疑，他被逼迫着思考一切的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"危机从何处来？它何时降临泰拉？他穷尽自己毕生所知，尝试解读不可解读的，理解不可理解的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果存在一种生命形式，甚至只是一个生物个体，能够在万物寂灭的宇宙中存活，它到底会怎样诞生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果时间无限长，一尾细小的鳞也能在终端上拍打出终极真理。但对我们而言，时间恰恰是最奢侈的资源......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼前的巨兽固然预见了毁灭的前景，但祂与祂的子嗣究竟能不能成为生机的延续者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倘若能......那它们需要多庞大的种群规模，多夸张的繁衍效率，才能在有限的时间内凭借本能穷举出克服毁灭的答案？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们需要蛀空一片海域、一颗行星，还是一个星系？它们的生，要以多少的死为代价？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倘若它们不能，那真正的答案又在哪里？大洋的另一面，天穹的另一侧，还是泰拉人无法触及的星海之间？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哪怕穷尽你的一生，你也不可能得出准确的结论。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你所掌握的信息根本不足以供你演算所有的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，凯尔希。但是曾经的玛利图斯不得不尝试推演。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"危机与可能性同时悬于他的头顶，而他的脚下，是一根无形的钢丝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你本可以第一时间通报国家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈尔会接过你所惧怕的一切，科学院最古老的典籍能验证你所见的过去，技术院最先进的设备能预演你所见的未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将选择权交予他人，是解脱，还是逃避？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"百千万人所做出的选择，相比于寥寥几人所做出的选择，是更准确，还是更模糊？更郑重，还是更随意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倘若生机延续的手段不是文明，克服毁灭的物种不是人类，阿戈尔会是怎样的态度......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够了，玛利图斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你一开始就想到了种种可能性，预见到了这些惨痛的代价，那你最后选择堕落的行为只会更加不可原谅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，阿戈尔人，我没有在为自己辩解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想说的是——就在那时，有一只幼小的生命体打断了我的胡思乱想。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它的触肢细小，身体也不协调，半透明的皮膜下，简单的脏器清晰可见......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它从Ishar-mla体内诞生，它不知道何时爬过了舱壁，正在毫无顾忌地舔舐着我的脚踝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它难道不知道自己很快就将死去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"监测面板上的生物讯号密密麻麻，它不知道自己的结局只是变成其中一个毫无意义的字符？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它由巨兽所孕育，它难道看不见巨兽所见的那可怖的景象？它难道不清楚整个族群的宿命，都只在于预告毁灭、迎接毁灭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不......它只是向着注定的毁灭平静地蠕行着。本能，只靠本能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而我们呢，在做出一个决定之前，总有无数可能要去衡量，无数顾虑要去取舍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们无法不在意自己的决定会带来怎样的代价、造成怎样的结果、又能创造怎样的价值......它到底，有没有意义......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"人类啊，咕——所以我们永远自我囚困，所以我们永远迟“命运”一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是，海嗣与人类最本质的区别。这是，它们足以承载存续之使命的原因。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g6_aegirarena"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"所以你吃下了异种的血肉？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"所以你变成了现在这个模样？","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"所以你决定插手文明的演化？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那个万物寂灭的未来里，有任何生命能以任何形式存活下来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都值得我以任何代价去争取。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“此处并无正义，唯有前路。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，你应该理解，你应该帮助大群进化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我与博士曾面对过许多存在——他们中有些甚至已经不再能被称为人类。出于类似的决意，他们都艰难地做出了取舍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唯有你的决意，令人胆寒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在吃下异种的血肉变成海嗣之前，你便放弃了作为人类去思考。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我看来，那些在最后一刻被你抛下的怀疑、顾虑、担忧和挣扎，才是最珍贵的事物......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"它们可贵，正因它们没有尽头。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣正在吞噬泰拉的其他生命——你没有否认也无法更改这个事实。我们要如何认同它为，“希望”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，难道你选择孵育“源石”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"崩塌的星门，熄灭的石棺......无数的计划已经崩毁，如今仍在运转的，是否只剩下，源石？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"土地与空气中的石头，沉默的石头，它们是顽疾，它们同样在伤害陆地上的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们同样是先史文明遗留的计划，它们同样被期待能够在最后的最后，保护所有生命和存在......以常人难以理解的方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咕——生存的阶梯，只能由毁灭来铸造。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，这种毁灭不应该发生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与深蓝之树一样，源石同样在某个时间点，发生了一些无人知晓，且已经永远无法扭转的变化......它导向你所说的毁灭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然它已经发生，那它应该被阻止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，以生机喂养生机，以毁灭堆砌毁灭，这都是在抹杀生命的意义。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......凯尔希，资料里的AMa-10，你让我感到意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你我本应殊途同归。不，你应当比我更加理性，更加决绝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是意外发现了先史文明的火种，接下了它。而你却是为此而生。在我之前，你已经执火奔行了上万年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你守望遥远的夙愿与遗产，你践行被赋予的使命。你见证变迁，你承受失去......一个人类，做不到这般苦心孤诣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在的你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，漫长的“寿命”反而让你变得软弱，变得像一个人类了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凯尔希一直如此。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你完全不了解凯尔希。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为......这个人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，还是......“预言家”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"许多处设施，许多扇门扉，指纹、面容、声音......那深蓝的洞穴，遗迹群中的无数所在，留有你的痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你曾到访过海洋深处。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"可惜我想不起来了......","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我认出了你。但与凯尔希交流，效率更高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你绝不可能不知情，你的到访必定事出有因，或许，你能解释项目为何停滞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你改变了称呼，你的身上一定发生了什么......否则，与你同行的凯尔希不会对计划的变故存有疑问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......因为某些原因，博士已经不记得当年发生的许多事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（颅腔内的核转动）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“失去记忆”......咕，并不意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"应当说，对你们而言，失去记忆或许只是最微不足道的牺牲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上万年的时间，哪怕再坚韧的生命，也无法对抗如此漫长时间的侵蚀，而你仍存在于如今的泰拉，这本身已是奇迹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我所见的，祂，祂们所见的，那些可怖的景象，对你们而言，是绝对的真实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们失去引以为傲的文明和家园，大地与星空都褪去色彩，时间和空间变成了漫无边际的监牢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们被绝望放逐，你们在泰拉停歇，你们没有躲过注定的毁灭......一切人消陨，一切事无意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尽管如此，你们依然不曾停止争抢希望，这颗星球上永存着你们抗争的痕迹......尽管它们多数只剩残骸和废墟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我敬畏你，和你们的事业——上个时代的人们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"一只海嗣肯定了我的过去？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"如果你说的事业也包括了如今的“海嗣”......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"也许项目停滞，正因参与者意识到了代价。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，肯定，否定，不作表态，你都可以。我并不希望从你的话语中获得任何理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并非在寻求你的认同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，你的同僚们，确实在海洋深处种下了一个希望，一个可能，一枚火种。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许你们遗忘了它，或许你们放弃了它，或许你们如今要对抗它，无论发生了什么......现在，是我照拂它的光亮，让它不被熄灭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来自引火之人的否定，也不能动摇如今的族群。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我们抛弃无谓的自证吧，让我们回归现实本身。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"族群感受到了危机，那云层之外的眼睛或许已窥见泰拉的异常，危机正悬于所有人的头顶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"泰拉只是囚笼，它困住了无数不知真相的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，“囚笼”出现缺口。这是危机，也是生机。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听。看。嗅闻。触摸。海浪在欢涌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在泰拉的囚笼当中，海的子嗣，已然是生命力最为强韧的族群，它没有一刻停止进化......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们无可否认，大群，已经成长为壮美的奇迹。它们会成为宇宙大爆炸后的火种，整个宇宙重新绽放的基点......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们最接近......成功。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回答我，凯尔希，Dr.{@nickname}，还有阿戈尔人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时至今日，你们选择支持人类，源石，还是海嗣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"的确，危机正在迫近，而我仍有许多问题无法解答，许多真相无从得知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这不意味着，生命就只能被抽象成一个空洞的概念，这无异于抹杀它本来的意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛利图斯，你认为这是一种软弱。而我认为，这是漫长“寿命”赋予我的决意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"生命的价值应该由生命自己赋予。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"生命的意义应该由生命自己谱写。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣是必须消除的灾难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这一点上，我和博士的态度不会改变，罗德岛的态度不会改变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没有文明，谈何存续？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有存续，谈何文明？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这场荒唐的辩论到此为止，玛利图斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弥利亚留姆已经将病变的器官清除出体外，你那些渗入城市的同类正在被清剿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克莱门莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_1382_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在监牢中，你会有足够的时间反思一切，交代还没有交代的事情。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（愤怒的嘶鸣）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈尔人，还有那漆黑的小怪物......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用试图留下我，仅凭你们，仅凭这座城市，没有能力杀死我，杀死Ishar-mla。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这座城市已经完成了重组，我能想象到它横亘在海流中的身姿，但族群会越过它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们没有对错。就让所剩无多的时间，就让这场对抗，为我们提供最有力的明证。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，我将唤醒沉眠的“初生”，我将引领族群前往月亮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“海嗣”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1383_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，还有Dr.{@nickname}，你们将成为这壮美循环的一部分。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g20_lighthouse_core"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圣徒阁下，艾丽妮向您复命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必多说，阿戈尔已经向我们同步了水下发生的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希和罗德岛的博士呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还在那座城市里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"审判庭文员","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——接通了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海面上的实时影像，由阿戈尔的无人机矩阵直接投映在大灯塔的显示系统上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣潮与阿戈尔的城市，同时在靠近陆地......距离我们不过十余海里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那些翻飞的泡沫，那些交错的水流，全都是......海嗣？它们甚至改变了海水本身的颜色......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这还只是它们暴露在海面上的部分，只是冰山一角。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣利用了阿戈尔与陆地接触的契机，整片海域几乎都已经化作它们的巢穴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈尔的防线——画面里那座变形的城市，能支撑多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是否可以认定，阿戈尔的航道计划以失败告终了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"弥利亚留姆，现在城市里所有的阿戈尔人......都还没有放弃努力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"两个月来，惩戒军从伊比利亚的海岸线上征调了所有还能航行的船只，它们已经在格兰法洛休整完毕，准备出海。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我会亲自带领惩戒军出发，作为阿戈尔防线的补充，共同抵御海嗣浪潮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"艾丽妮，你没有太多休息的时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是，我已经在灯塔下看到了列阵的审判官们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"终于，伊比利亚不再拥有哪怕一丝行差踏错的余裕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"存续......或者毁灭，别无他途。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果阿戈尔的高墙倾倒，那就由我们告诉那些海嗣，陆地存在的意义，以及亵渎它的代价。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g20_lighthouse_core"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那个，老师，艾丽妮阁下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乔迪，你就留在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这座灯塔是我们最后的据点，惩戒军在战场上的所有军事行动需要依赖它发出的信号。做你能做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们看窗户外面......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......光亮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那好像是——灯塔的光亮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是伊比利亚之眼，不是只剩我们脚下这一座还能运作吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事，为什么突然接收到了这么多相同的信号？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，已经被汪洋吞噬的海岸线上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些死寂了半个多世纪的灯塔......全都亮起来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾丽妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*伊比利亚感叹词*！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣徒卡门","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些沉默的岛民科技，它们在回应什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g12_diving"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"乌尔比安听到城市重组的轰鸣在头顶响起，看着失去辉光的信标塔缓缓沉入海渊。\n那座曾承载无数同胞伟大愿景的建筑已经被海嗣选作了新的育生巢。\n衰老的个体将身躯化作养分倾注其中，它们的征程将由不计其数的新生个体延续。\n海嗣总是如此，对于认定的同胞，它们毫无保留地奉献，不遗余力地哺育。\n这让乌尔比安短暂地感到恶心。\n巨锚的重量顺着手臂清晰地传递到他的肩头，意识到自己将永远不再被认同、不再被铭记的那个瞬间，乌尔比安感到前所未有地清醒。\n他还不能斩断自己与海嗣之间那令人作呕的联系，但他应当还有余力截断涌向城市的狂潮。\n歌蕾蒂娅说得没错，在急剧孵化的巢穴战斗，自己或许很快就会被海嗣同化，那么等待自己的究竟是死亡，还是......\n乌尔比安奋力挥锚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"像是能预知乌尔比安的动作，微小的新生命轻盈地躲过他的挥击，而后若无其事地拂过他的锚爪。他调整气息，计算方向，再次挥出——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"新生的生命","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（极其微弱的机械鸣响）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":"avg_4145_Ulpia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一只新生的幼小生命从乌尔比安的眼前掠过，它优雅地翻身，肚腹中微小的精密机械结构一闪而过。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"然后是两只，三只——新生的集群连成一道纤细的光路，点亮了混沌的浪潮。\n形态各异的成体海嗣紧密地簇拥着它们，为它们扇动海流，护它们游向远方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣，你们在簇拥什么，保护什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"停下来的海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"停下来的海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"养分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"停下来的海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"停下来的海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"同胞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"停下来的海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还有你，Ul-pianus......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"停下来的海嗣","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大群，连成一体......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"作为技术院曾经最优秀的执政官之一，乌尔比安确信自己不会认错，眼前这些源源不断从信标塔中脱离的奇妙个体......\n是曾经寄居在信标塔中的微型浮游机械，一段中止的历史，一个夭折的梦。\n而作为深海猎人，他同样信任自己的嗅觉——它们的气味与海嗣无异。\n那些早在两百年前便胎死腹中的“信标”重新获得了生命，它们由海嗣重新孵育，再与海嗣一起，游向狂潮凝聚的海面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔比安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈尔，自取灭亡的阿戈尔，你仍然没有放弃博弈，还是，这本来就在你的计算里？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"起初，只是一点荧光。\n继而，是一根流动的线条。\n紧接着，是一方轻盈的网格，在海面延展开来。\n......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"数以亿计的微型浮游机械与海的子嗣一同摆动身躯，与浪涛同沉同浮。\n它们的光芒微小却清晰，渺茫却坚定。光的通路在海嗣的躯体间跳跃。\n海流串联起散落在大洋中的每一处巢穴，海嗣源源不断地从海洋各处向陆地汇拢，却也为光的通路画出了曼妙的延长线——\n纵横交错，彼此呼应，光路织成的网如同星河在海面铺开，以弥利亚留姆为起点，逶迤向海洋的最深处，无限远的地方。\n航道——海洋中的路网，连通陆地与海洋，跨越狂乱无序的空间与平静流动的时间。\n它与大群同在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
